  "slug": "electrical-change-order-request-form",
  "title": "Electrical Change Order Request and Impact Decision",
  "subtitle": "Preserve the electrical baseline, document the changed condition and evidence, price scope and schedule effects, obtain a clear decision, and control implementation.",
  "description": "A decision-ready Electrical change order request covering contract and baseline identity, requester direction, field evidence, revised technical scope, quantity and cost support, schedule and safety effects, alternatives, authorization, rejection or hold handling, implementation, and closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use when the electrical foreperson, project manager, estimator, customer, and authorized approver need a traceable Electrical change record before changed work proceeds, except for separately controlled emergency stabilization.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
